From 073782780594669c41e301601110ef907d701a6f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Emil <emil.grotta@colorado.edu>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 08:31:26 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] feat(acp): report per-turn token usage from the prompt
 response

Map the usage an ACP agent returns with session/prompt into the normalized
per-turn TurnTokenUsage on the provider turn, so features that read it (such
as the tokens/sec readout) work for ACP providers.

ACP marks the field unstable and does not say whether outputTokens already
includes thoughtTokens, so a report that carries thought tokens is recorded as
partial rather than guessed complete. Malformed counts and absent usage leave
the turn without a total.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
